<!--Problem#9*************************************************-->
<exercise includeAutoNumber="true"><title /><p>
Graph your above Forward Euler approximations on the below axes  The coarse approximation is for the case where you used two steps of length <m>\Delta t = 1</m>.  The finer approximation is for the case where you used four time steps of length <m>\Delta=\frac{1}{2}</m>.</p>

<!-- graph 3 -->


<setup>
  <odeSystem variables="z" initialconditions="-0.8" name="ode">
    <rightHandSide>-z^2+1</rightHandSide>
  </odeSystem>
  <boolean name="showExact">false</boolean>
  <boolean name="showdt1">false</boolean>
  <boolean name="showdt05">false</boolean>
</setup>

<p>
  <updateValue name="revealdt1" type="boolean" target="$showdt1" newValue="true" hide="$showdt1">
    <label>Show coarse approximation</label>
  </updateValue>
  <updateValue name="hidedt1" type="boolean" target="$showdt1" newValue="false" hide="not $showdt1">
    <label>Hide coarse approximation</label>
  </updateValue>
  <updateValue name="revealdt05" type="boolean" target="$showdt05" newValue="true" hide="$showdt05">
    <label>Show finer approximation</label>
  </updateValue>
  <updateValue name="hidedt05" type="boolean" target="$showdt05" newValue="false" hide="not $showdt05">
    <label>Hide finer approximation</label>
  </updateValue>
    <updateValue name="revealExact" type="boolean" target="$showExact" newValue="true" hide="$showExact">
      <label>Show solution</label>
    </updateValue>
  <updateValue name="hideExact" type="boolean" target="$showExact" newValue="false" hide="not $showExact">
    <label>hide solution</label>
  </updateValue>
</p>

<graph xmin="-0.4" xmax="2.5" ymin="-1.2" ymax="1.2" width="500" aspectRatio="5/4" fixAxes="true" grid="true">
  <xLabel><m>t</m></xLabel>
  <yLabel><m>z</m></yLabel>

  <function extend="$ode.numericalSolution" styleNumber="4" hide="not $showExact" />

  <point name="P1_0" x="0" y="0" styleNumber="1" hide="not $showdt1">
    
      <constrainToGrid dx="10" dy="0.2" />
      <constrainToGraph />
    
  </point>
  <point name="P1_1" x="1" y="0" styleNumber="1" hide="not $showdt1">
    
      <constrainToGrid dx="10" dy="0.2" xoffset="1" yoffset="$fe1_1" />
      <constrainToGraph />
    
  </point>
  <point name="P1_2" x="2" y="0" styleNumber="1" hide="not $showdt1">
    
      <constrainToGrid dx="10" dy="0.2" xoffset="2" yoffset="$fe1_2" />
      <constrainToGraph />
    
  </point>
  <polyline stylenumber="1" vertices="$P1_0 $P1_1 $P1_2" fixed="true" hide="not $showdt1" />


  <point name="P05_0" x="0" y="0" styleNumber="2" hide="not $showdt05">
    
      <constrainToGrid dx="10" dy="0.2" />
      <constrainToGraph />
    
  </point>
  <point name="P05_05" x="0.5" y="0" styleNumber="2" hide="not $showdt05">
    
      <constrainToGrid dx="10" dy="0.2" xoffset="0.5" yoffset="$fe05_05" />
      <constrainToGraph />
    
  </point>
  <point name="P05_1" x="1" y="0" styleNumber="2" hide="not $showdt05">
    
      <constrainToGrid dx="10" dy="0.2" xoffset="1" yoffset="$fe05_1" />
      <constrainToGraph />
    
  </point>
  <point name="P05_15" x="1.5" y="0" styleNumber="2" hide="not $showdt05">
    
      <constrainToGrid dx="10" dy="0.2" xoffset="1.5" yoffset="$fe05_15" />
      <constrainToGraph />
    
  </point>
  <point name="P05_2" x="2" y="0" styleNumber="2" hide="not $showdt05">
    
      <constrainToGrid dx="10" dy="0.2" xoffset="2" yoffset="$fe05_2" />
      <constrainToGraph />
    
  </point>
  <polyline stylenumber="2" vertices="$P05_0 $P05_05 $P05_1 $P05_15 $P05_2" fixed="true" hide="not $showdt05" />


</graph>

<p>Check <m>\Delta t =1</m> approximation:
  <answer matchPartial="true">
    <award referencesAreResponses="$P1_0 $P1_1 $P1_2">
      <when>
        $P1_0.y = $z0
        and
        $P1_1.y = $fe1_1
        and
        $P1_2.y = $fe1_2
      </when>
    </award>
  </answer>
</p>


<p>Check <m>\Delta t = \frac{1}{2}</m> approximation:
  <answer matchPartial="true">
    <award referencesAreResponses="$P05_0 $P05_05 $P05_1 $P05_15 $P05_2">
      <when>
        $P05_0.y = $z0
        and
        $P05_05.y = $fe05_05
        and
        $P05_1.y = $fe05_1
        and
        $P05_15.y = $fe05_15
        and
        $P05_2.y = $fe05_2
      </when>
    </award>
  </answer>
</p>




<p>You can compare your solution to the <q>actual solution</q> by checking the button.  (The <q>actual solution</q> is really just an approximation via an algorithm like Forward Euler, but with a small time step.)</p>
</exercise>


<solution>


<ol>

<li><p>
The phase line:

<graph width="500" aspectRatio="50/15" xmin="-2" xmax="2" ymin="-3" ymax="3" displayYAxis="false" fixAxes="true">
  <xLabel><m>z</m></xLabel>
  <equilibriumPoint x="-1" y="0" stable="false" fixed="true" styleNumber="9" />
  <equilibriumPoint x="1" y="0" stable="true" fixed="true" styleNumber="9" />
  <vector styleNumber="2" tail="(-1.1,0)" head="(-1.9,0)" fixed="true" />
  <vector styleNumber="2" tail="(-0.9,0)" head="(0.9,0)" fixed="true" />
  <vector styleNumber="2" tail="(1.9,0)" head="(1.1,0)" fixed="true" />
</graph></p>

</li>

<li><p>
By solution, we mean with initial condition <m>z(0)=$z0 </m>.  The only curve that we need is the following.

 <graph width="500" aspectRatio="5/4" ymin="-2" ymax="2" xmin="-0.5" xmax="4" fixAxes="true">
   <xLabel><m>t</m></xLabel>
   <yLabel><m>z</m></yLabel>

    <function domain="(0,10)">1 - 1.8 exp(-x/0.5)</function>
    
    
  </graph>
</p>
</li>

<li><p>
<m>z'(0)=1-z(0)^2 = 1-($z0 )^2 = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fun_z0 </number></round></m></p>
</li>

<li><p>
The formula for a linear approximation around <m>t=0</m> is
<me>L(t) = z(0) + z'(0)(t-0).</me>
Since <m>z(0)=$z0 </m> and <m>z'(0)=<round numDigits="4"><number>$fun_z0 </number></round></m>, the linear approximation for <m>z(t)</m> is
<m>z(t) = <math extend="$lin0.formula" /></m>.</p>
</li>

<li><p>
<m>z(1) = -0.7 + 0.51 (1) = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe1_1 </number></round></m>.</p>
</li>

<li><p>
<md>
  <mrow>z(0+\Delta t)\amp = z(0) + f(z(0))\Delta t</mrow>
  <mrow>z(1)\amp = $z0  + f($z0 ) \cdot 1</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = $z0  + <round numDigits="4"><number>$fun_z0 </number></round> = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe1_1 </number></round></mrow>
</md></p>
</li>

<li><p>
<md>
  <mrow>z(2)\amp = z(1)+f(z(1)) \cdot 1</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe1_1 </number></round> + f(<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe1_1 </number></round>)</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe1_1 </number></round>+ <round numDigits="4"><number>$fun_fe1_1 </number></round> = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe1_2 </number></round></mrow>
</md></p>
</li>

<li><p>
<md>
  <mrow>z(1/2)\amp = z(0)+f(z(0))(1/2)</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = $z0  + f($z0 )/2</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = $z0  + <round numDigits="4"><number>$fun_z0 </number></round>/2 = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_05 </number></round></mrow>
</md>
<md>
  <mrow>z(1)\amp = z(1/2)+f(z(1/2))(1/2)</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_05 </number></round> + f(<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_05 </number></round>)/2</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp =<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_05 </number></round> +<round numDigits="4"><number>$fun_fe05_05 </number></round>/2 =<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_1 </number></round></mrow>
</md>
<md>
  <mrow>z(3/2)\amp = z(1)+f(z(1))(1/2)</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_1 </number></round> + f(<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_1 </number></round>)/2</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_1 </number></round> + <round numDigits="4"><number>$fun_fe05_1 </number></round>/2 =<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_15 </number></round></mrow>
</md>
<md>
  <mrow>z(2)\amp = z(3/2)+f(z(3/2))(1/2)</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp =<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_15 </number></round> + f(<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_15 </number></round>)/2</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp =<round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_15 </number></round> + <round numDigits="4"><number>$fun_fe05_15 </number></round>/2 = <round numDigits="4"><number>$fe05_2 </number></round></mrow>
</md></p>

</li>

<li><p>
A plot of the two Forward Euler solutions along with the actual solution:
   
<graph xmin="-0.4" xmax="2.5" ymin="-1.2" ymax="1.2" aspectRatio="5/4" fixAxes="true" grid="true">
  <xLabel><m>t</m></xLabel>
  <yLabel><m>z</m></yLabel>

  <function extend="$ode.numericalSolution" styleNumber="4" />

  <point name="P1s_0" x="0" y="-0.8" styleNumber="1" fixed="true" />
  <point name="P1s_1" x="1" y="$fe1_1" styleNumber="1" fixed="true" />
  <point name="P1s_2" x="2" y="$fe1_2" styleNumber="1" fixed="true" />
  <polyline stylenumber="1" vertices="$P1s_0 $P1s_1 $P1s_2" fixed="true" />


  <point name="P05s_0" x="0" y="-0.8" styleNumber="2" fixed="true" />
  <point name="P05s_05" x="0.5" y="$fe05_05" styleNumber="2" fixed="true" />
  <point name="P05s_1" x="1" y="$fe05_1" styleNumber="2" fixed="true" />
  <point name="P05s_15" x="1.5" y="$fe05_15" styleNumber="2" fixed="true" />
  <point name="P05s_2" x="2" y="$fe05_2" styleNumber="2" fixed="true" />
  <polyline stylenumber="2" vertices="$P05s_0 $P05s_05 $P05s_1 $P05s_15 $P05s_2" fixed="true" />


</graph></p>

</li>


</ol>

</solution>


</problem>